    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Great Harvester</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A farming sim\u2026 with a body count.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/e941001efaa607bc5176ee3a132f88af.poster.avif?t=1754417213\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/e941001efaa607bc5176ee3a132f88af.webm?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/e941001efaa607bc5176ee3a132f88af.mp4?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life in the town of Great Harvest should have been peaceful. Instead, you find your husband brutally murdered. Worse? The town locks you away in a loony bin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, one year later, you\u2019re back to rebuild your life as a humble farmer\u2026 or are you? When the Devil shows up,  he brings an offer. So, if you want revenge, it looks like your going to have to learn to harvest more than just corn...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/7c7f954e5ca42bfaf5428ec8100269e4.poster.avif?t=1754417213\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/7c7f954e5ca42bfaf5428ec8100269e4.webm?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/7c7f954e5ca42bfaf5428ec8100269e4.mp4?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm by day, murder by night</strong> \u2013 Build your farm by planting crops, raising livestock and decorating your home. Help the community by beautifying the town, doing quests and making small talk with the lovely townsfolk\u2026 all before turning them into compost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong> \u2013 Kill with whatever  you have on hand. An axe? Brutal. A shovel? Effective. A bag seeds? Hope you have a backup plan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and strategy matter</strong> \u2013 Kill too recklessly, and the cops will be on your trail. Dispose of bodies, destroy evidence, eliminate witnesses, and don\u2019t get caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deal with the Devil\u2026 or a loophole with an Angel?</strong> \u2013 <i>Satan</i> isn\u2019t the only one with an interest in the souls of your\u00a0town. Maybe you can weasel your way out of eternal damnation yet...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sinful romances</strong> \u2013 Flirt with the Devil\u2026 Bewitch the Angel. Or both! Watch as celestial rivalry turns romantic in a hilariously twisted love triangle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey through Hell</strong> \u2013 Descend through a darkly satirical take on Dante\u2019s nine circles. Face absurd bosses and thematic realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A darkly comedic story</strong> \u2013 In a town full of quirky, oblivious characters, discover the dark secret behind your husbands murder and &quot;deal&quot; with those who stand in your way.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/ef5889ecc1517c3e59b3d0f47bb9249b.poster.avif?t=1754417213\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/ef5889ecc1517c3e59b3d0f47bb9249b.webm?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/ef5889ecc1517c3e59b3d0f47bb9249b.mp4?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fulfill your contract and take revenge? Will you find a way to the final circle of hell? Either way, get ready to reap what you sow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now\u2014before the Devil changes his mind.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Great Harvester</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A farming sim\u2026 with a body count.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/e941001efaa607bc5176ee3a132f88af.poster.avif?t=1754417213\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/e941001efaa607bc5176ee3a132f88af.webm?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/e941001efaa607bc5176ee3a132f88af.mp4?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life in the town of Great Harvest should have been peaceful. Instead, you find your husband brutally murdered. Worse? The town locks you away in a loony bin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, one year later, you\u2019re back to rebuild your life as a humble farmer\u2026 or are you? When the Devil shows up,  he brings an offer. So, if you want revenge, it looks like your going to have to learn to harvest more than just corn...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/7c7f954e5ca42bfaf5428ec8100269e4.poster.avif?t=1754417213\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/7c7f954e5ca42bfaf5428ec8100269e4.webm?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/7c7f954e5ca42bfaf5428ec8100269e4.mp4?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 