9249b.webm?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534500/extras/ef5889ecc1517c3e59b3d0f47bb9249b.mp4?t=1754417213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fulfill your contract and take revenge? Will you find a way to the final circle of hell? Either way, get ready to reap what you sow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now\u2014before the Devil changes his mind.</strong></p>",
