        "notes": "Great Harvester contains themes of murder, demonic contracts, and dark comedy centered around a revenge-driven protagonist. Players take on the role of a serial killer under a pact with the Devil, requiring them to stealthily eliminate townsfolk.\r\n\r\nThe game includes:\r\n\r\nFrequent depictions of cartoon violence, including cartoon blood, and murder.\r\n\r\nThemes of death, the afterlife, and moral dilemmas.\r\nDark humor and satirical depictions."
